{"id":"09df50f7db3de7ca","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-kummer-complex.md","title":"Kummer Complex c.e. Sets","display":"df-kummer-complex — Kummer Complex c.e. Sets","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-kummer-complex","aliases":["43-df-kummer-complex"],"display":"df-kummer-complex — Kummer Complex c.e. Sets","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-kolm]]","[[43-df-infseq]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Definition 19.1.3 read with Theorem 19.1.5(iii)(a)","source_printed_pages":"570–571","source_pdf_pages":"590–591","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-kummer-complex"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-kummer-complex</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kummer-complex — Kummer Complex c.e. Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 19.1.3 read with Theorem 19.1.5(iii)(a)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"570–571"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"590–591"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 以特征函数视为二进制序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KummerComplex}\">\\(\\mathrm{KummerComplex}\\)</span> 由本节 Assertion 的形式定义引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KummerComplex}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j\\ge\\max\\{N,2\\}\\}\\;C(A\\upharpoonright n)\\ge2\\log_2n-d.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KummerComplex}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j\\ge\\max\\{N,2\\}\\}\\;C(A\\upharpoonright n)\\ge2\\log_2n-d.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>草稿 Definition 19.1.3 写成“for each d”，但紧接的存在性证明与 Gap Theorem (iii)(a) 使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\\log n-O(1)\">\\(2\\log n-O(1)\\)</span>，正确机器不变定义需存在固定亏损常数；这里依据同页定理及证明改为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists d\">\\(\\exists d\\)</span>，并明确记录该草稿量词不一致，未静默逐字转抄。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Definition 19.1.3 read with Theorem 19.1.5(iii)(a)；印刷页 570–571，PDF 页 590–591。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 以特征函数视为二进制序列；$\\mathrm{CE}$、$C$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-kolm]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 以特征函数视为二进制序列；$\\mathrm{CE}$、$C$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-kolm]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KummerComplex}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KummerComplex}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j\\ge\\max\\{N,2\\}\\}\\;C(A\\upharpoonright n)\\ge2\\log_2n-d.","display":true},{"tex":"2\\log n-O(1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists d","display":false}],"bytes":1678,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-477","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-kummer-complex]] — Kummer Complex c.e. Sets"},{"id":"7ced88dac63c9bc6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KummerComplex}$ 见 [[43-df-kummer-complex]]，采用其固定加性亏损的定义。"},{"id":"071deac27e228ccf","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\operatorname{CE}(A)$；$\\operatorname{ArrayComputable},\\operatorname{ArrayNoncomputable}$ 见 [[43-df-array-computable]]，$\\operatorname{KummerComplex}$ 见 [[43-df-kummer-complex]]，$C$、$\\equiv_T$、$\\operatorname{Order}$ 见 [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-order-function]]。集合按特征序列取初段。"}],"outgoing":["6c0559518cd32104","a0589ee7a1cc12e8","565c3258eee2a5ff"]}